1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,089
Welcome to AIM-YA – AI Mindfulness for Young Adults.

2
00:00:03,129 --> 00:00:07,073
AI is changing how we learn, work, and imagine our futures.

3
00:00:07,113 --> 00:00:10,463
For many students, that change brings real questions.

4
00:00:10,503 --> 00:00:12,364
Will my career still exist?

5
00:00:12,403 --> 00:00:14,198
Can I trust what AI tells me?

6
00:00:14,238 --> 00:00:15,524
Am I keeping up?

7
00:00:15,563 --> 00:00:19,356
If you felt some of that unease, you're not alone, and it has a name:

8
00:00:19,396 --> 00:00:21,003
AI anxiety.

9
00:00:21,043 --> 00:00:23,849
AIM-YA was developed at the University of Central Florida

10
00:00:23,889 --> 00:00:27,525
to help you meet these changes with clarity instead of stress.

11
00:00:27,565 --> 00:00:28,728
Over the next 4 weeks,

12
00:00:28,768 --> 00:00:32,663
you'll combine short mindfulness practices with guided reflection

13
00:00:32,703 --> 00:00:35,063
on how AI shows up in your life –

14
00:00:35,103 --> 00:00:39,450
your studies, your future work, and the choices you make every day.

15
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:41,634
Each week includes a brief mindfulness practice

16
00:00:41,674 --> 00:00:44,955
to study your attention and ease stress,

17
00:00:44,995 --> 00:00:49,344
a reflection activity to explore your thoughts and feelings about AI,

18
00:00:49,384 --> 00:00:52,313
and a metacognition check in to notice how you're thinking,

19
00:00:52,353 --> 00:00:54,554
not just what you're thinking.

20
00:00:54,594 --> 00:00:57,161
There's nothing to master and no right answer.

21
00:00:57,201 --> 00:00:58,403
The goal is simple:

22
00:00:58,443 --> 00:01:02,767
to build the awareness and AI competencies that help you stay grounded,

23
00:01:02,807 --> 00:01:05,591
thoughtful, and human as AI evolves.

24
00:01:05,631 --> 00:01:06,811
Before you begin,

25
00:01:06,852 --> 00:01:10,452
you'll be asked for your consent and to complete a short check-in survey.

26
00:01:10,492 --> 00:01:14,568
You'll take it again at the end, so you can see how your experience has shifted.

27
00:01:14,608 --> 00:01:15,710
Take a breath.

28
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:17,134
Let's begin.
